#: data/maps/Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse/scripts.inc:59
msgctxt "Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse_Text_MySonIsStrongerThanYou"
msgid ""
"You're the first TRAINER I've seen who\n"
"deploys POKéMON so masterfully.\p"
"But, I should tell you--my son is\n"
"stronger than you.\p"
"He even took the POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
"challenge, I'll have you know.$"
msgstr ""
"你是我见过的第一个能如此娴\n"
"熟地指挥宝可梦的训练家。\p"
"不过，\n"
"我得告诉你——我儿子比你还要强。\p"
"告诉你吧，他还去挑战过宝可梦联盟呢。$"

#: data/maps/Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse/scripts.inc:67
msgctxt "Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse_Text_LikeYouToHaveMachoBrace"
msgid ""
"We use this MACHO BRACE to more\n"
"effectively strengthen our POKéMON\l"
"in training.\p"
"Since you've beaten all of us here,\n"
"I don't know if you need it, but we\l"
"would like you to have our MACHO BRACE.$"
msgstr ""
"我们在训练时，会用这个强制锻炼\n"
"器来更有效地增强宝可梦的实力。\p"
"你已经打败了我们所有人，\n"
"虽然不知道你还需不需要，\l"
"但我们想把这个强制锻炼器送给你。$"

#: data/maps/Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse/scripts.inc:75
msgctxt "Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse_Text_PassionateAboutBattles"
msgid ""
"When it comes to POKéMON battles,\n"
"we tend to be pretty passionate.$"
msgstr ""
"一说到宝可梦对战，\n"
"我们就会变得非常热血。$"

#: data/maps/Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse/scripts.inc:79
msgctxt "Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse_Text_StrongerFamilyMembers"
msgid ""
"Mommy is stronger than Daddy.\p"
"I'm stronger than Mommy.\p"
"And Grandma's stronger than me!\p"
"But my big brother is even stronger\n"
"than Grandma.$"
msgstr ""
"妈妈比爸爸强。\p"
"我比妈妈强。\p"
"奶奶比我还要强！\p"
"不过我哥哥比奶奶还要强。$"

#: data/maps/Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse/scripts.inc:86
msgctxt "Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse_Text_GrandsonStrong"
msgid ""
"There's no question that you're strong.\p"
"But if you were to battle my grandson,\n"
"you'd end up crying in frustration.\p"
"He's much stronger than any TRAINER\n"
"our family knows.\p"
"He must be challenging the POKéMON\n"
"LEAGUE CHAMPION by now.\p"
"Knowing my grandson, he could be the\n"
"CHAMPION already!$"
msgstr ""
"毫无疑问，你很强。\p"
"但如果你和我孙子对战，\n"
"一定会懊恼得哭出来的。\p"
"他比我们家认识的\n"
"任何训练家都要强得多。\p"
"他现在一定正在\n"
"挑战宝可梦联盟的冠军吧。\p"
"以我孙子的实力，\n"
"说不定已经当上冠军了！$"

#: data/maps/Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse/scripts.inc:97
msgctxt "Route111_WinstrateFamilysHouse_Text_GrandsonStrongShort"
msgid ""
"My grandson must be challenging the\n"
"POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION by now.\p"
"Knowing my grandson, he could be the\n"
"CHAMPION already!$"
msgstr ""
"我孙子现在一定正在\n"
"挑战宝可梦联盟的冠军吧。\p"
"以我孙子的实力，\n"
"说不定已经当上冠军了！$"
